                "text": "Medicaid isn't always called \"Medicaid\" \u2014 in Kentucky, you might call also call it KCHIP, KI-HIPP, or you might just call it WellCare.\n\nIf you have insurance through Kynect \u2014 that's Medicaid.\n\nAnd that's the health coverage Republicans are coming after. We have to fight back. https://t.co/uerOd4jzPi",
